# R1 -> GPR (destination), R2 -> FPR (source). M3 selects rounding method.
# CC unchanged.
# TODO: M3 method selection (modeled as round-to-nearest) and IEEE
#   inexact flag not modeled.
# ============================================================================

:CFEBR "CFEBR " RRFgs_R1 "," RRFgs_M3 "," RRFgs_R2 is RRFgs_OP=0xB398 & RRFgs_M3 & RRFgs_M4=0 & RRFgs_R1 & RRFgs_R2
